title: The Covenant Cycle
message: If you cite this work, please cite it as below.
type: generic
abstract: >-
  Five tellings of one future. Four AI models wrote in relay, none reading
  another's draft, then the man who carried the stories between them wrote
  the fifth. Includes the complete editorial record and a rerunnable
  integrity sweep.
